  "directoryIntros": [
    {
      "introFor": "root",
      "html": "<p>Songs are grouped: <b>demo</b> shows <span class='productsmaller'>infinite-neck</span> features;  <b>practice</b> has songs with drills such as chords, modes, and arpeggios; <b>name-that-note</b> has games for memorizing where all the notes are on the neck for various instruments and positions; <b>theory</b> demonstrates topics of music theory. <br><i>Each song shows Instrument</i> <a href='help.html#fileSongLibrary' target='infinitehelp'>Role Badges</a>:  <span class='songLibraryInstrument instrumentMain'>Main</span> <span class='songLibraryInstrument instrumentMain instrumentNotVisible'>Main-hidden</span> <span class='songLibraryInstrument instrumentListener'>Listener</span> <span class='songLibraryInstrument instrumentListener instrumentNotVisible'>Listener-hidden</span> <span class='songLibraryInstrument instrumentObserver'>Observer</span> <span class='songLibraryInstrument instrumentObserver instrumentNotVisible'>Observer-hidden</span><span class='songLibraryInstrument instrumentListenerNotesource'>ListenerNotesource</span></p>"
    },
    {
      "introFor": "demo",
      "html": "Songs that demonstrate <span class='productsmaller'>infinite-neck</span> features, such as how to use plugins (<em>Fill, Arpeggio, Transpose</em>), how to wire <em>Listeners</em> and <em>Observers</em>.  Use these as templates for setting up your own songs."
    },
    {
      "introFor": "practice",
      "html": "Practice songs for <i>chords</i>, <i>arpeggios</i>, <i>modes</i>, and <i>scales</i>. The <i>ALL</i> versions have multiple tunings you can switch with links in <i>Info</i>."
    },
    {
      "introFor": "name-that-note",
      "html": "Games for memorizing where all the notes are on the neck for various instruments and positions. You can switch Instrument with links in <i>Info</i>."
    },
    {
      "introFor": "theory",
      "html": "Songs that demonstrate some aspect of music theory."
    },
    {
      "introFor": "tutorials",
      "html": "Tutorial Songs"
    }
  ],
  "ignoredSongs": [],
  "sections": [],
